cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, cite it and the tag you used."
title: "neuron-closed: closed-form selection of (layer, neuron) positions and their doses for Qwen3.5-4B"
abstract: >-
  A closed-form solver for neuron-level steering: u = W B^-1 d*, budget sqrt(u'Mu),
  positions chosen by greedy maximisation of Q(S) = g_S' M_SS^-1 g_S, with every claim
  re-derived by `make check`. Includes the measurement protocol, the agreement and the
  stated boundaries (direction reproducible across objectives, but a behaviourally
  searched short list is not recoverable from a local expansion).
authors:
  - name: "neuron-closed authors"
version: 0.47.0
date-released: "2026-10-29"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ebotian/neuron-closed"
keywords:
  - mechanistic interpretability
  - neuron steering
  - closed-form control
  - Qwen3.5-4B
